{"completed": true, "response": "{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y压缩掉了一些关键心理因果，尤其是从怕给对方添负担到怕失去对方、再到不愿藏回喜欢的变化过程，不如X交代得充分。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的大字亮词让我边听音乐边扫屏时，能迅速抓住每段的核心情绪和转折；按小节出现的感受又能把音乐变化接到具体的身体感觉、画面和细微心理上，不必全部读完也能有所体会。X对人物为什么犹豫、为什么收住、又为什么逐渐敢于表达，以及前后事件如何相互影响，讲得更完整，但左侧长句和右侧大量短词同时争夺注意力。综合实际观看体验，Y更容易让我在有限时间里抓住主线并感受到音乐中的细腻变化，尽管人物心理的连续性不如X扎实。\"\n}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2df1b381-bd1f-413c-9c28-038f1cfe6752", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T043947875620Z", "elapsed_seconds": 103.36, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T04:41:31.241425+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "944039fe91aa6eaf7c4b71dcedfa86426e25fca375412f63a737583f3c4bd0c3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_w